#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:1
msgid ""
"**Warning**   \n"
"This program is [**experimental**](../../development/experimental-features."
"md#xp-feature-nix-command) and its interface is subject to change."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:8
msgid "`nix nar` - create or inspect NAR files"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:12
msgid "`nix nar` \\[_option_...\\] _subcommand_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:14
msgid "where _subcommand_ is one of the following:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:16
msgid ""
"[`nix nar cat`](./nix3-nar-cat.md) - print the contents of a file inside a "
"NAR file on stdout"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:17
msgid ""
"[`nix nar dump-path`](./nix3-nar-dump-path.md) - serialise a path to stdout "
"in NAR format"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:18
msgid ""
"[`nix nar ls`](./nix3-nar-ls.md) - show information about a path inside a "
"NAR file"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:19
msgid ""
"[`nix nar pack`](./nix3-nar-pack.md) - serialise a path to stdout in NAR "
"format"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:21
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:23
msgid ""
"`nix nar` provides several subcommands for creating and inspecting [_Nix "
"Archives_ (NARs)](../../store/file-system-object/content-address.md#serial-"
"nix-archive)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:26
msgid "File format"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar.md:28
msgid ""
"For the definition of the Nix Archive file format, see [within the protocols "
"chapter](../../protocols/nix-archive/index.md) of the manual."
msgstr ""

